      "message": "feat(tools,ui): built-in ER11-ER40 collet chucks; flare and Weldon screw envelopes\n\nStandalone straight-shank ER11, ER16, ER20, ER25, ER32 and ER40 chucks\njoin the holder library, drawn from one shared ER nut table (ER_SIZES)\nthat the BT/CAT ER entries use too; BT40 ER40 is added. #800's review\nenvelopes: a 45-degree cone from the body out to the flange front\ncovers the body-to-flange flare, and a Weldon body is drawn 1 mm wider\nin radius for its clamp screw head. The picker shows the projection\nbeside the gauge length, applied through the same undoable command,\nand its live shank check reads the stored tool, as Apply does.\n\nFixes #792\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
