      "message": "feat(tools): built-in Tormach TTS holders (ER20, ER16, set-screw)\n\nNine TTS entries in the holder library: TTS ER20 (52 mm installed\nheight) and ER16 (49 mm) from Tormach's product pages, and the set-screw\nholders 1/4, 5/16, 3/8, 1/2 in and 6, 10, 12 mm. The TTS mount is a\nzero-standoff Taper: its collar's top face is the gauge line, the\nshoulder Tormach measures every tool from, so projection plus gauge\nlength is the collar-to-tip length the setter reads. Unpublished collar\nand body sizes are enveloped at the TTS blank's 1.5 in, never smaller.\nThe picker names the collar. The machine-file default is filed as #828\n(no holder field in .mch; the MX mills are BT30, not TTS).\n\nFixes #794\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
